		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6A507C6B66A619AF"]
			description: [
				"Ecologics enriches selected vanilla biomes with plants, animals and materials. Autumnity gives autumn forests their own life and palette. Upgrade Aquatic expands aquatic and wetland detail."
				"These mods reward looking closely at an ordinary beach, forest or marsh instead of treating only enormous modded biomes as content."
				"Use Jade to identify the mod behind a new plant or creature, then check JEI before collecting it. Some small features are habitat, food or decoration rather than progression loot."
				"Biome mods overlap by design: terrain shape, biome identity, foliage, animals, and ambient details can come from different projects. Use Jade, F3 biome information, and JEI rather than identifying only by colour."
			]
			id: "448B7E869179E500"
