		{
			dependencies: ["0049FA32C35487D9", "448B7E869179E500"]
			description: [
				"Immersive Weathering adds environmental change to blocks and landscapes. Surfaces can age, moss, crack or accumulate natural detail depending on material and surroundings."
				"Prototype a wall outside before using a weather-sensitive palette across a whole town. JEI and the mod configuration reveal methods for encouraging, preventing or reversing changes."
				"Weathering is storytelling when it is intentional. Use it to distinguish a maintained home, working yard and abandoned ruin instead of letting every surface become visual noise."
				"Immersive Weathering and seasonal colour make the world visibly change. Photograph the same landmark across time and use material ageing deliberately when maintaining public builds."
			]
			id: "5F4797613D215365"
			rewards: [{
				id: "793B66EF27715C26"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
